{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52842","headline":"古意 · 蒋冽","name":"古意","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"昨夜巫山中，失却阳台女。\n今朝粧阁里，独伴楚王语。\n（见《文苑英华》卷二百五）（按：《才调集》卷十收此诗爲蒋藴作，《全唐诗》卷七九九收入。\n未详孰是，今两存之。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"蒋冽","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52842.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52842","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}